  "details": "When you're using shield settings on Custom and have Avatars set to Off, the rating icon on the Show Avatar Stats button is just white until you show their avatar again. \n(If you've already seen their avatar the image stays \"correct\" to what you saw on the rating when it was viewed)\nSteps:\n- Set Shield Level to Custom\n- Set Avatar to Off\n- Open QM and click on someone\n- The rating icon on the Show Avatar Stats button should show as a white square.",
